        "pl-extract.jsonl": [],
        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cbabef24-bebb-3aa3-b21c-4f8d0c5e9b01",
                "word": "parbleu",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e8a21118-4b1f-3c1a-a572-1b4070d179b5",
                        "entry_id": "cbabef24-bebb-3aa3-b21c-4f8d0c5e9b01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sorte de juron."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2c7f18a-89d3-4927-bfb0-2b5e9ecba6f4",
                                "sense_id": "e8a21118-4b1f-3c1a-a572-1b4070d179b5",
                                "text": "Salviati, s’asseyant. – Voilà une jolie femme qui passe. — Où diable l’ai-je donc vue ? — Ah ! parbleu ! c’est dans mon lit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e729dc60-f3c9-4de9-b7c4-565a6b6c5bb5",
                                "sense_id": "e8a21118-4b1f-3c1a-a572-1b4070d179b5",
                                "text": "— On les condamne donc à mort ceux qui vont proclamant des vérités,\n— Tiens !… Parbleu !… Il ne manquerait plus qu’on les nommât ministres ou archevêques… ou qu’on leur donnât la croix de la Légion d’honneur !… Ah ! çà !… D’où venez-vous ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e0cb153-561e-4a85-951c-3824ecd1003c",
                                "sense_id": "e8a21118-4b1f-3c1a-a572-1b4070d179b5",
                                "text": "« Charles va bien ?… » avait demandé Lirat… Charles ?… son mari, parbleu !…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48414701-8083-444e-bb63-f15b831492f1",
                                "sense_id": "e8a21118-4b1f-3c1a-a572-1b4070d179b5",
                                "text": "— Est-ce que, par hasard, il n’y aurait pas une couchette libre ?\n— Pas en première… Mais je crois qu’il y en a une en seconde… Si cela vous est égal…\n— Parbleu !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48d0e2b1-961a-4c25-9f8a-c42e2349d985",
                                "sense_id": "e8a21118-4b1f-3c1a-a572-1b4070d179b5",
                                "text": "Les Chasseurs n’étaient peut-être pas non plus étrangers à cette manigance. Parbleu, en se débarrassant d’un concurrent, ils profitaient de son gibier."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96ed39d1-baae-44a8-b590-5991bf7c35bf",
                                "sense_id": "e8a21118-4b1f-3c1a-a572-1b4070d179b5",
                                "text": "Je déteste les Allemands, parbleu, mais sans conviction."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a783b8e3-f770-49a4-9753-147be7a69521",
                        "source_entry_id": "cbabef24-bebb-3aa3-b21c-4f8d0c5e9b01",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8a21118-4b1f-3c1a-a572-1b4070d179b5",
                        "source_sense_description": "Juron où « bleu » est substitué a « Dieu » pour éviter le blasphème",
                        "target_lang_word": "by Jove",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "by Jove",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7da5209-a8f8-34c2-b014-2fffa3d93cd7",
                                        "entry_id": "688e4dbc-fe1f-3e39-833f-46d699736b45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Invocation of the Roman god Jupiter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "062e7463-aa7e-4665-98bd-f8dab9835b78",
                                                "sense_id": "f7da5209-a8f8-34c2-b014-2fffa3d93cd7",
                                                "text": "By Jove, master marchant, by sea or by land / Would get but smale argent if I did not stand / His very good master, I may say to you, / When he hazards in hope what hap will insue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdf4c797-513c-4b81-a701-f03735143e1b",
                                                "sense_id": "f7da5209-a8f8-34c2-b014-2fffa3d93cd7",
                                                "text": "By Joves help I'l^([sic]) be there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e80e506d-c82e-3350-ad7c-9d5dc1fdaed1",
                                        "entry_id": "688e4dbc-fe1f-3e39-833f-46d699736b45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "minced oath for by God, Jove referring to Jupiter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d86b982e-f1f5-4a70-91e0-6a41a26fc528",
                                                "sense_id": "e80e506d-c82e-3350-ad7c-9d5dc1fdaed1",
                                                "text": "By Jove, I always took three threes for nine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93d0ad51-170c-42cc-a892-95ec0e4ea2f5",
                                                "sense_id": "e80e506d-c82e-3350-ad7c-9d5dc1fdaed1",
                                                "text": "Favours, by Jove that thunders! What art thou, fellow?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd72d6c7-0cb3-4f7b-8914-e9d94f624d88",
                                                "sense_id": "e80e506d-c82e-3350-ad7c-9d5dc1fdaed1",
                                                "text": "\"Oh, as to that!\"—and Lord Fulkeward roused himself to some faint show of energy. \"Who wouldn't admire her? By Jove! Only, I tell you what—there's something weird about her eyes. Fact! I don't like her eyes.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86446bc5-5a91-4ff3-91ff-237768fa9677",
                                                "sense_id": "e80e506d-c82e-3350-ad7c-9d5dc1fdaed1",
                                                "text": "\"I was sorry to fire my rifle, but, by Jove! there was no great choice.\" \"We should not be here if you hadn't,\" said I, with conviction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c00a86ff-0a6e-4c12-99fd-2df187814004",
                                                "sense_id": "e80e506d-c82e-3350-ad7c-9d5dc1fdaed1",
                                                "text": "“By Jove! I’ve left my ulster in the waiting-room,” and hastened off to fetch it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fccf973-9272-4f8f-93eb-294513417ccf",
                                                "sense_id": "e80e506d-c82e-3350-ad7c-9d5dc1fdaed1",
                                                "text": "Well, I wasn't going to have any of that sort of thing, by Jove!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "565b22d0-38ba-4c00-bfac-ff20201399e6",
                        "source_entry_id": "cbabef24-bebb-3aa3-b21c-4f8d0c5e9b01",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8a21118-4b1f-3c1a-a572-1b4070d179b5",
